peacemachine-dvd-ripper (1.0.28) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Use the Flatpak HandBrake (fr.handbrake.ghb) when there is no native
    HandBrakeCLI. That is the only way to get HandBrake on Alma/RHEL 10, where
    RPM Fusion ships none at all. Needs `flatpak override --device=all
    fr.handbrake.ghb` so the sandbox can reach the drive.

